# A character being judged is not yet a character being shipped.
# Deliveries under inspection sit in assets/inbox_* so the checkers can
# reach them over the probe server without 18MB of candidate entering
# history; *.probe.mjs are the throwaway harnesses that photograph
# them. Both are recreated per delivery and belong to the session, not
# the repository.
assets/inbox_*
*.probe.mjs
